                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6">

                            <div class="leader-service-card">

                                <i class="fas fa-handshake"></i>

                                <h5>

                                    Social Welfare

                                </h5>

                                <p>

                                    Community welfare programmes and public outreach
                                    activities.

                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <!-- LEADERSHIP PHILOSOPHY -->

                <div class="about-quote-box">

                    <i class="fas fa-quote-left"></i>

                    <h4>

                        Leadership is about serving people with honesty,
                        commitment and dedication while working towards
                        inclusive development and public welfare.

                    </h4>

                </div>

                <!-- REFERENCES -->

                <div class="about-content-card">

                    <h3>

